# -*- mode: sh -*-

# x-sailjail-description = Read Wi-Fi scan results from wpa_supplicant
# x-sailjail-long-description = Allows harbour-idrone to read per-BSS beacon data
#   (including Remote ID vendor IEs) from wpa_supplicant over the system D-Bus
#   (fi.w1.wpa_supplicant1). Receive-only; the app never configures Wi-Fi.

dbus-system.talk fi.w1.wpa_supplicant1

# Base.permission forces `net none` (network-less namespace), which blocks the
# opt-in OpenStreetMap map-background fetch. Ignore it so the app shares the host
# network. (Distributed via OpenRepos/Chum, not the Harbour store.)
ignore net none
